    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>N</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>⟶</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>NH</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Initial mole</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>4</mn> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Reacted mole</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> </mtd><mtd>&nbsp;</mtd></mtr><mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Left mole</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>4-3=1</mn> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>2</mn> </mtd> </mtr></mtable></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> left = 1 mol<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> formed = 2 mol<br /><br />But <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> dissolves in water forming <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> . Residual gas is only <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> which exerts pressure.<br /><br />Volume <math><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> (5L occupied by <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> added)<br /><br /><math><mo>